=== V1 and V2 -- PERMANENT tests, not plants, and here is why ===
  Both defects exist as real callable code that is worth keeping:
    V1  WaveSpeedEstimator::Davis -- the estimator the authorization SUGGESTED, measured to
        fail the signal-bounding criterion W4 in 8 of 14 cases against the exact solver.
    V2  hllFluxForControlOnly()   -- HLLC with the contact wave deleted, i.e. HLL, which the
        frozen G6 criterion itself names as the non-vacuity backbone.
  Both are asserted by permanent tests (W4_NonVacuity_Davis..., T4_NonVacuity_Deleting...,
  and V2_...OnDeviceToo), so they are re-checked by every future regression instead of living
  in a script that may never be run again.

